{
  "id": "1SA.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Sam 14",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 52,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eshomo Yonatan aarare Ilfilisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki nabo olong Yonatan olayioni le Saul olbarnoti apa onap imasaa enyena o larrabal, “Wou, maape iyiook enetii oltim loo Lfilisti te lido kekun.” Kake eitu ninye eliki menye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netonita apa Saul te netaaniki Gibea ti abori olchani otii Migron; ore iltung'ana apa ootii te nebo ninye nebaya iip ile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Ahija olayioni le Ahitab, ilo alashe le Ikabod olayioni le Finehas, olayioni le Eli, ilo apolosani lo Laitoriani te Shilo eishop enkila dorrop. Neitu eyiolou iltung'ana aajo eshomo Yonatan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te mpaash te ine apa neim Yonatan elo oltim loo Lfilisti netii apa emarti enchoto nabo o emarti te nkae shoto; neji nabo Boses neji enkae Sene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore emarti nabo neitashe te moikuape te dukuya Mikmash ore enkae te kopikop te dukuya Geba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yonatan ilo barnoti apa onapita imasaa enyena o larrabal, “Wou, maape iyiook enetii oltim le kulo lememurata; eidimayu pee eret Olaitoriani iyiook; amu meetae ae toki naidim aibooi Olaitoriani amitiki eitajeusho too lkumok arashu too lkuti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ilo onapita imasaa enyena olarrabal ninye, “Taasa anaa eniyieu niaas; ng'ura, atii nanu te nebo iyie, anaa enatiu ndamunot inono neijia etiu inaainei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye Yonatan, “Ng'ura, eikilang iyiook aapuo enetii ilewa, nikintodol ate ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ejoki iyiook, ‘Entaanyisho o maetu iyiook enitii intae;’ nikintashe iyiook aaitirring'a te wueji ang, nimikilep iyiook aapuo enetii ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake te nejo ninche, ‘Wootu elepu enikitii,’ nikilep iyiook aapuo; amu eishorua Olaitoriani ninche apik enkaina ang. Neaku ele olmonekie te iyiook.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoduaaya pokira oare ate to ltim loo Lfilisti; nejo Ilfilisti, “Eng'ura, epuonu Ilhebrania aaipang'u too ngumot te nenen apa neisudorie ate.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipotu lelo tung'ana lo ltim, Yonatan o ilo anapani loo masaa enyena olarrabal nejo, “Elepu wootu enikitii, naa eikintodol intae entoki.” Nejoki Yonatan ilo anapani lenye, “Ilepu wou tusujuaki amu eishoo ninche Olaitoriani metijing'a atua enkaina e Israel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neked Yonatan ailep too nkaik enyena o too nkejek, nesuju olanapani lenye. Nebatata ninche te dukuya Yonatan near ilo anapani ninche metuata te siadi ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo meneng'a le dukuya, ooitayutuo Yonatan o ilo anapani lenye, nebaya iltung'ana tikitam te rishata naba anaa olpisiai le eka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejing enkuretisho ilng'oborri, o ong'ata, o atua iltung'ana; ore oltim o lelo oarisho neikirikira; neikirikira enkop neaku olkirutoto kitok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emirata oo Lfilisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neing'or ilarripok le Saul te Gibea e Benchamen; naa ng'ura, eidapashari olorora idie o idie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Saul lelo tung'ana ootii te nebo ninye, “Enkenisho eng'urai kaing'ae oshomo ti atua iyiook.” Ore ake pee eidip aaikenisho, ng'ura, metii Yonatan o lanapani lenye loo masaa olarrabal ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Saul Ahija, “Iyau ene ilo Sanduku le Nkai.” Amu kelo apa ilo Sanduku le Nkai ina kata te nebo iltung'ana le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore egira Saul airorie olapolosani, neponari olodoo too lng'oborri loo Lfilisti oleng oleng; nejoki Saul ilo apolosani, “Tushuko enkaina ino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Saul o lelo tung'ana pooki apa ootii te nebo ninye neipirri aapuo olarrabal; naa ng'ura, ore ake olalem lo ltung'ani near olikae, netii apa olmilo kitok oleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina kata Ilhebrania apa ootii te nebo Ilfilisti te dukuya ina kata, lelo ooshomo aailep atua ilng'oborri, eibelekenyate aaku te nebo Israeli apa ootii te nebo Saul o Yonatan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neijia eikununo, ore iltung'ana pooki le Israel apa ooisudoitie ate te ina kop oo ldoinyo e Efraim nening nchere eisikita Ilfilisti; nesuju sii ninche te ngolon epuo enjore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etokordua Olaitoriani Israel ina olong; ore olarrabal negiroo te idiaalo Bes-afen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inkiaasin te siadi olarrabal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenyamalu iltung'ana le Israel ina olong; amu einosie Saul iltung'ana olmumai, ejo, “Ediaa ilo tung'ani onya endaa o metaba anaa neaku teipa aitalakua too lmang'ati laainei.” Neaku meetae obo too ltung'ana oishamishama endaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuonu iltung'ana pooki atua entim; netii apa enaisho enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee ejing iltung'ana entim, ng'ura, eitong'ita olkenkei le naisho, kake meetae oltung'ani otipika enkaina enkutuk; amu etureita iltung'ana ilo mumai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitu ening Yonatan eitanap papaai lenye iltung'ana ilo mumai; neaku eisuroko eng'udi apa natii enkaina, nepik atua lukuny oo naishi nepik enkaina enkutuk; newang'u nkonyek enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo obo loo ltung'ana, “Eitanapa papaai lino iltung'ana akurraki to lmumai, ejo, ‘Ediaa ilo tung'ani onya endaa ena olong.’ ” Netanaurate iltung'ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Yonatan, “Eitanyamala papaai enkop; ng'ura ajo etawang'ita nkonyek aainei enkaraki naishamishama enkiti ena aisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kebaa na eikash tenaa keinosa iltung'ana ena olong nena yarunot oo lmang'ati lenye naaineputua ninche. Amu ore taata earata olalem too Lfilisti neme kitok.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
