                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki ninche Saul, “Ng'ura, easita iltung'ana eng'oki to Laitoriani, aanya nkiri te nebo osarge.” Nejo ninye, “Itaasa te nkaldaroto; embeleleng'u osoit sapuk ene natii nanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Saul ajo, “Endapashaki ate atua olorere, nijokiki ninche, ‘Nchoo pooki tung'ani meyau olkiteng lenye arashu enker enye, neyieng ninche tene, nenya; nimiasiasa eng'oki to Laitoriani aanya nkiri te nebo osarge.’ ” Neaku eyaua pooki tung'ani olkiteng lenye te nebo ninye ina kewarie apa, neyieng ninche te ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neshetu Saul olperere lo lasar lo Laitoriani; naa olperere lo lasar le dukuya oitera Saul ashetaki Olaitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
