        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Saul ajo, “Matadoi aapuo aasujaa Ilfilisti nikimbung, nikiya ntokitin enye nikiar kewarie ninche o mekenyu; miking'uaa iyiook oltung'ani obo te ninche.” Nejo ninche, “Taasa enaba anaa enidol aa sidai te iyie.” Kake etejo olapolosani, “Maigutu iyiook aanyikaki Olaitoriani tene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neikilikuanishore Saul Enkai, “Amaa, kalo nanu adoyio asujaa Ilfilisti? Amaa nchoru ninche apik atua enkaina e Israel?” Kake eitu ninye ewaliki ninye ina olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Saul ajo, “Wootu ene, intae ilarikok pooki loo ltung'ana; entayiolo nidolidolo eneikununye ena ng'oki taata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore anaa enaishu Olaitoriani, ilo oitajeu Israel, hoo tenaa atua Yonatan, olayioni lai etii meeta nchere meye ninye.” Kake metii apa oltung'ani ti atua iltung'ana pooki otawalikia ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninye ajoki Israel pooki, “Entijing intae enkalo nabo, ore nanu o Yonatan, olayioni lai, nikijing enkae shoto.” Nejoki iltung'ana Saul, “Taasa ina nidol aa sidai te iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 27.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 28.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neaku etejo Saul, “Olaitoriani Enkai oo Siraeli, kainyoo pee eitu iwaliki osinka lino ena olong? Tenaa atua nanu etii ena torroni arashu atua Yonatan, olayioni lai, Olaitoriani Enkai oo Siraeli, nchoru Urim; kake tenaa atua iltung'ana linono Israel etii ena torroni, nchoru Tummin.” Neyae Yonatan o Saul, nepok iltung'ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Saul ajo, “Entoosh enkukuo te rishata nanu o layioni lai Yonatan.” Neyae Yonatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
